4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski","html_url":"https://github.com/peteski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T08:52:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T08:52:15Z","body":"Hey thanks for checking that out. It's still a real pain for me :/ \nI'm almost certain it's the new **_right click to undo view navigation_** feature, but I can't find where that was added and there doesn't seem to an option to disable it. \nI'll try it one some other hardware configs and see what I come up with.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4978720932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5310099219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120422#issuecomment-5310099219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120422","id":5310099219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPIGvEw","user":{"login":"peteski","id":3522412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjI0MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3522412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski","html_url":"https://github.com/peteski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peteski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-16T22:57:14Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T23:00:00Z","body":"I had a chance to have another look at this and I found that if I comment out the line \"cancel_navigation();\" from the view_3d_controller.cpp file, it fixes the issue. So at least it seems like I might be on the right track.\n\n```\nbool View3DController::gui_input(const Ref<InputEvent> &p_event, const Rect2 &p_surface_rect) {\n\tRef<InputEventMouseButton> b = p_event;\n\tif (b.is_valid()) {\n\t\tif (b->get_button_index() == MouseButton::RIGHT && b->is_pressed() && navigating) {\n\t\t\tcancel_navigation();\n\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t}\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5310099219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5401934032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120422#issuecomment-5401934032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120422","id":5401934032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQfr40A","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar